id: pm-graph-ipvn
title: Refresh managed pm-github extension for PM CLI 2026.9.26
description: "The tracker began with a managed pm-github 2026.8.18 copy and package development tools at 2026.9.23. Host CLI 2026.9.26 reported extension version skew. Refresh the project-scoped managed extension and exact compatible CLI, pm-ops, and pm-changelog pins, then copy the published canonical merge-driver launcher. Preserve the disabled scheduled sync workflow. CLI 2026.9.27 requires a later pm-github release before strict extension health can pass."
type: Issue
status: in_progress
priority: 1
tags: []
created_at: "2026-09-27T07:07:21.121Z"
updated_at: "2026-09-27T07:22:31.207Z"
assignee: codex
claim_principal: codex
author: codex
acceptance_criteria: "Install published pm-github 2026.9.26 in project scope; verify installed manifest and managed metadata, package activation, strict health, release gate and privacy diff; leave scheduled GitHub sync disabled until its pre-push privacy gate exists.; The package manifest and lockfile resolve CLI 2026.9.26, pm-ops 2026.9.26, and pm-changelog 2026.9.25 exactly.; The launcher is byte-identical to the published pm-ops template."
severity: medium
environment: pm-graph canonical checkout with host pm CLI 2026.9.26
repro_steps: Run pm health --strict-exit --json in fleet/pm-graph; inspect extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew and .agents/pm/extensions/pm-github/package.json.
expected_result: Managed pm-github resolves against host PM CLI 2026.9.26; strict tracker health exits zero.
actual_result: Managed pm-github copy is 2026.8.18; strict health exits one.
notes[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-09-27T07:15:27.801Z",codex,"First full release:check ran 292 tests and failed exactly one assertion: the prepare launcher was not the unmodified published pm-ops template. Copied the installed pm-ops 2026.9.26 template byte for byte; will rerun the full gate. This is the published local broken-install guard, not the unmerged hoisted guard from pm-ops #124."
  "2026-09-27T07:21:59.571Z",codex,"The npm registry published @unbrained/pm-cli 2026.9.27 while pm-github latest remains 2026.9.26. A real local CLI 2026.9.27 probe failed strict health with extension_host_pm_cli_version_skew:2026.9.27:2026.9.26:pm-github. Reverted the development CLI pin to the newest compatible published pair (2026.9.26) and retained the verified green release gate. Fleet certification must revisit this after pm-github 2026.9.27 is published; do not call this latest-CLI certification."
files[4]{path,scope,note}:
  .agents/pm/extensions/.managed-extensions.json,project,Exact project-scoped pm-github source
  package-lock.json,project,Resolved dependency lock
  package.json,project,Compatible exact development tool pins
  scripts/prepare-merge-driver.ts,project,Published pm-ops 2026.9.26 canonical launcher copy
tests[2]:
  - command: pm health --strict-exit --json
    scope: project
    provenance:
      author: codex
      created_at: "2026-09-27T07:07:21.121Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: fix/pm-graph-github-extension-cli-compat-2026-09-27
  - command: "npm run release:check"
    scope: project
    timeout_seconds: 600
    provenance:
      author: codex
      created_at: "2026-09-27T07:22:23.666Z"
      source_kind: local_mutation
      source_ref: fix/pm-graph-github-extension-cli-compat-2026-09-27
docs[1]{path,scope,note}:
  "https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli-companion/blob/main/.agents/pm/features/pm-cli-website-377e.toon",global,Fleet GitHub sync rollout
